# Per-file production-line budgets — the large-file ratchet.
#
# Generated and maintained by `just sizes-bless`; enforced by
# `just lint-sizes` (tools/fq-lint) in the Code quality CI job.
#
# Production lines = total minus `#[cfg(test)]` items, measured off a
# real syn AST rather than by matching source text.
#
# Every file here exceeds the 800-line cap and is pinned at its size when
# the ratchet landed. These numbers may only ever go DOWN. Lowering one
# is automatic (`just sizes-bless`); raising one, or admitting a new
# file, means hand-editing this file so a human sees it in the diff.
#
# The three entries that motivated this gate have their own split issues:
#   services/fq-runtime/crates/fq-cli/src/lib.rs                       -> #189
#   services/fq-runtime/crates/fq-runtime/src/worker/reducer/runner.rs -> #78
#   services/fq-runtime/crates/fq-runtime/src/mcp.rs                   -> #191
